{{ macros.section(2, "Banana Blocks", id="banana-blocks") }}

{{ macros.escape_hatch([
    'The [compiler tutorial](@/cmk/compiler/#banana-forms) introduces the block in context, next to the other [call-forms](@/cmk/concepts/#callforms) and [block-references](@/cmk/compiler/#block-references) it composes with.',
